/Title (AGE OF TRANSITION & THE MENTAL SINGULARITY)
/Author (Nina Chao)
/Subject (This socio-legal analysis explores Artificial Superintelligence, Brain-Computer Interface integration, post-scarcity economics, and Electric Technocracy. It examines the transition from Homo sapiens to a cognitively networked civilization, redefining AI governance, global sovereignty, automation, and the Mental Singularity in a hyper-real, abundance-driven future.)
/Keywords (Artificial Superintelligence, ASI governance, Brain Computer Interface, BCI integration, Mental Singularity, Post Scarcity Economy, Electric Technocracy, AI Ethics, Global Governance, Homo Nexus, Technological Singularity, Automation Economy, Post Work Society, Cognitive Augmentation, Neural Integration, Juridical Singularity, International Law, Sovereignty Collapse, Digital Abundance, AI Policy, Superintelligence Risk, Future Civilization, Neurotechnology, CRISPR, Human Enhancement, Algorithmic Governance, Post Scarcity Society, AI Regulation, Hyper Reality, Global Transformation)
>>
endobj
